  "description": {
    "text": "The Metal deck (钢属性对战卡组) is one of the eight decks of the Battle Party Set. Its Pokémon are Onix, Steelix, Aggron, Metagross, Celesteela, Melmetal, Lickitung, Lickilicky and Snorlax. Its cards are numbered out of 24, and its Metal Energy is unnumbered.\n\nThe Battle Party Set (对战派对组合) came out on 15 April 2023: a box of eight ready-made 60-card decks, one each for Grass, Fire, Water, Lightning, Psychic, Fighting, Darkness and Metal, built from cards released up to Striking Competition, for eight players to battle with straight away. Each deck came as three 20-card packs. Every copy of a deck has the same cards, but some boxes had holo packs, the same cards in holo finish. At first the box could only be played at Battle Party events in gyms and partner shops, where each player drew a deck at random; it went on sale in shops on 1 February 2024."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSMPhC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 024"
  },
